    SA_EPP -->|"bound via Helm"| EPP_CR
    EPP_CR -->|"get, list, watch"| InferencePool
    EPP_CR -->|"get, list, watch"| Pods
    EPP_CR -->|"get, list, watch"| Endpoints

    %% External CRDs (referenced but not managed)
    Gateway -.->|"referenced by guides"| SA_MS
    HTTPRoute -.->|"referenced by guides"| SA_MS
    LWS -.->|"referenced by wide-EP guide"| SA_MS

